# ==============================================================================
# DOCKER IGNORE CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# --- Host Dependency Isolation ---
# Exclude host machine node_modules so Docker does not copy host binaries into the container.
# The container runs `pnpm install` internally to generate clean, Linux-native binaries.
node_modules
backend/node_modules
frontend/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# --- Host Build Artifacts ---
# Ignore host build output folders to prevent stale host code from contaminating image builds.
dist
build
.vite

# --- Version Control Metadata ---
# Exclude Git repository history and Git files to reduce Docker build context size and save time.
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# --- Documentation ---
# Exclude repository markdown files and non-runtime assets from the Docker build context.
README.md
LICENSE